WEBVTT

00:08.320 --> 00:11.400
But which way should I go?

00:12.610 --> 00:13.950
I have to get back.

00:15.740 --> 00:17.780
This is Aoshi's memory...

00:19.910 --> 00:21.290
It's the same?

00:21.290 --> 00:22.960
So I take a turn here?

00:31.340 --> 00:34.680
So that's how it is, Aoshi.

00:35.130 --> 00:38.430
Your memories have seeped right into this thing!

00:46.770 --> 00:47.900
It's the Argent!

00:47.900 --> 00:49.360
Akashi!

00:49.360 --> 00:50.530
Just one?

00:56.280 --> 00:57.200
Akashi!

01:18.760 --> 01:21.060
Akashi, are you all—

01:33.070 --> 01:38.660
The Dark Metal

01:33.110 --> 01:33.150
The Dark Metal

01:38.660 --> 01:43.080
Night turns to day, and day turns to night. Our wishes have wilted away

01:43.080 --> 01:47.250
Where did the person I want to meet go?

01:47.250 --> 01:51.710
Interlocking these fingers with my beloved

01:51.710 --> 01:55.470
Even though I can't feel them, I continue to live

01:55.510 --> 02:00.090
When the flower's petals

02:00.090 --> 02:04.220
Are plucked off by the wind's playful gale

02:04.220 --> 02:08.690
They are scattered in every direction

02:08.690 --> 02:14.030
Even if you long for it

02:15.030 --> 02:19.740
Don't disappear, just don't

02:19.740 --> 02:23.530
I can even give everything else away if I have to

02:23.530 --> 02:28.370
You were there, and I was there with you

02:28.370 --> 02:32.710
Let me take in these memories

02:32.710 --> 02:39.630
These brief moments are connected, turning it into eternity

02:56.530 --> 02:59.950
Episode 9
Blue Heart of Steel

02:57.280 --> 03:00.280
He said he's gonna stop piloting the Argent?

03:00.280 --> 03:03.280
And you dejectedly return after hearing that?

03:03.740 --> 03:05.790
Akashi no longer...

03:05.790 --> 03:07.080
Get him back on!

03:07.080 --> 03:08.370
It's his only choice!

03:08.910 --> 03:12.080
But the original objective has already been met.

03:12.080 --> 03:16.840
At present, there's no need to use
the Argent for the Lightless Realm.

03:16.840 --> 03:18.920
No, no, no.

03:18.920 --> 03:22.800
We need him to go back into
the Lightless Realm right away.

03:22.800 --> 03:25.930
The Sable was left behind, wasn't it?

03:25.930 --> 03:28.770
And only the Argent can go recover it.

03:28.770 --> 03:31.770
But Heito's likely already...

03:31.770 --> 03:34.440
That's not what I mean.
I'm talking about the Sable's LIM!

03:34.440 --> 03:35.730
The LIM!

03:36.360 --> 03:40.530
You should already know that
thing can't be made just like that.

03:41.820 --> 03:48.370
But as he is now, I doubt he'd be able to show any resonance even if he did pilot the Argent.

03:50.040 --> 03:53.370
We need to do something about that soon.

04:00.130 --> 04:01.510
So you're leaving.

04:01.880 --> 04:03.260
Yeah.

04:03.260 --> 04:06.140
There's no reason to be here
if I'm not piloting that thing.

04:06.760 --> 04:08.760
You've had it rough up until now.

04:10.060 --> 04:11.100
What?

04:11.730 --> 04:16.060
It was impossible for you to pilot the Reaper.

04:16.060 --> 04:20.150
And yet you tried your best
to the point of recklessness.

04:20.150 --> 04:21.320
It's all right.

04:21.320 --> 04:23.780
I'm sure everyone will understand.

04:25.030 --> 04:27.490
Yeah, I sure hope so.

04:47.600 --> 04:49.350
Your room's clean, isn't it?

04:49.970 --> 04:52.560
I came by to clean it a few times.

04:55.940 --> 04:57.440
Akashi, wait!

04:57.730 --> 05:00.270
There's something I have to tell you.

05:00.270 --> 05:02.610
There's nothing to say!

05:02.610 --> 05:04.610
Let go of my hand please.

05:08.490 --> 05:11.080
You're really gonna leave this place too?

05:11.080 --> 05:13.250
Do you know where you'll go?

05:13.660 --> 05:18.250
Wherever I end up is no longer
any of your business, Kasane-san.

05:26.930 --> 05:29.430
Is Akashi serious?

05:29.430 --> 05:32.770
Then what about Heito?

05:32.770 --> 05:36.060
Heito-san is a murderer, so...

05:36.390 --> 05:38.600
But he's still one of us!

05:38.600 --> 05:42.020
Only Akashi and the Reaper can go rescue him!

05:42.360 --> 05:45.570
Or rather, he'd be better off dead.

05:45.570 --> 05:47.280
Minashi! You...

05:47.820 --> 05:53.950
If he's alive, it means he's been putting up
with his psyche being invaded this whole time.

05:54.540 --> 05:56.250
It's been over ten hours.

05:56.960 --> 05:59.670
Which is why he'd be better
off dead instead of suffering.

06:01.380 --> 06:04.670
So we can't do anything at all?

06:18.980 --> 06:20.310
Want to see?

06:20.810 --> 06:23.190
You want to see the footage from the recorder?

06:30.990 --> 06:32.490
I have to get home.

06:33.450 --> 06:34.990
Aoshi!

06:33.740 --> 06:34.990
How many hours has it been?

06:36.540 --> 06:39.540
My leg... Why?

06:39.540 --> 06:43.840
My right arm won't move anymore either.

06:46.260 --> 06:49.010
Why is this happening?

06:49.010 --> 06:52.300
I have to hurry up and get back home.

06:54.180 --> 06:57.060
Nothing significant is on-screen.

06:57.060 --> 06:59.850
20% left on the battery.

07:01.400 --> 07:04.070
I'm going to try one last reboot.

07:05.150 --> 07:07.360
My left hand's the only thing not covered.

07:09.240 --> 07:10.910
I have to get back home.

07:10.910 --> 07:14.910
I promised I'd get back home.

07:14.910 --> 07:16.370
Kasane...

07:16.370 --> 07:17.330
Akashi...

07:20.540 --> 07:22.540
I see.

07:22.540 --> 07:26.710
The recorder unit was dropped when he rebooted.

07:31.050 --> 07:34.510
You failed to convince the little brother?

07:34.510 --> 07:36.760
Thank you very much.

07:36.760 --> 07:39.180
Kaneko-san moved too, right?

07:39.180 --> 07:41.850
We're planning to move
in with my parents soon.

07:41.850 --> 07:43.400
I'm jealous.

07:43.400 --> 07:45.980
My parents were from Tokyo too, so...

07:45.980 --> 07:47.820
Oh, that's right.

07:49.320 --> 07:50.650
Hayakawa
Station

07:49.320 --> 07:50.650
Hayakawa
Station

07:52.280 --> 07:54.620
Papa! Look at that! Vroom-vroom!

07:54.620 --> 07:55.780
You're right.

07:55.780 --> 07:58.290
Now let's hurry. Grandma's waiting.

07:58.290 --> 07:59.080
Yup!

08:14.640 --> 08:15.890
Sasame...

08:15.890 --> 08:18.890
You can see the ocean well from here.

08:18.890 --> 08:20.140
Yeah...

08:20.140 --> 08:22.520
I come out here every so often.

08:22.520 --> 08:23.980
Do you also?

08:23.980 --> 08:26.020
No, not so much...

08:26.610 --> 08:28.400
Why is this?

08:28.400 --> 08:32.070
I thought that I'd be able to see you if I came here.

08:32.070 --> 08:33.740
Synchronization of thoughts?

08:34.240 --> 08:36.530
You don't like things of that sort?

08:37.660 --> 08:38.740
Who knows?

08:40.410 --> 08:42.040
You're quitting?

08:42.040 --> 08:42.790
Yeah.

08:43.830 --> 08:46.170
You won't pilot the Reaper anymore?

08:47.630 --> 08:51.880
But you still have a desire to pilot the Reaper.

08:52.300 --> 08:53.340
I won't pilot it.

08:54.090 --> 08:55.840
I don't want to.

08:55.840 --> 08:57.850
I figured everything out already.

08:58.350 --> 08:59.310
I see...

09:00.810 --> 09:03.350
Do you think I'm running away all by myself?

09:05.480 --> 09:07.060
I don't think so.

09:07.980 --> 09:09.110
I mean it.

09:11.150 --> 09:14.240
What kind of things come to
mind when you look at the ocean?

09:15.200 --> 09:18.200
The people living across it

09:18.200 --> 09:23.080
and how they're having fun without a care in the world.

09:23.080 --> 09:24.160
What about you?

09:24.160 --> 09:25.540
All sorts of things.

09:27.170 --> 09:32.250
Nostalgic things, happy things, sad things...

09:32.250 --> 09:33.550
All sorts of things.

09:34.510 --> 09:35.550
I see.

09:38.180 --> 09:39.430
About that song...

09:40.300 --> 09:44.230
The one you sang on top of
that hill when I first saw you.

09:45.940 --> 09:49.310
I feel like I've heard that song in the past.

09:50.230 --> 09:53.530
I told you about my dream with the Corpse, right?

09:53.530 --> 09:54.780
Yeah...

09:54.780 --> 10:02.620
Maybe we really did meet somewhere, and you sang us that song.

10:04.040 --> 10:07.000
That song is so creepy.

10:07.710 --> 10:10.080
But for some reason it calms me down.

10:12.920 --> 10:16.050
Can you sing it one more time?

10:16.760 --> 10:17.880
I want to hear it.

10:20.890 --> 10:22.010
Sure.

10:24.010 --> 10:32.940
Toss a coconut onto the black of Corpses...

10:32.940 --> 10:37.570
Suspicions of Charon and Garon...

10:38.240 --> 10:46.080
One, meddling in affairs of crying children...

10:47.080 --> 10:53.840
Two, burn the bones of crying children...

10:53.840 --> 11:01.390
Three, atop the carcass is a crying child...

11:06.600 --> 11:11.730
I never wanted to see it again,
but I wonder if this place is all I have left.

11:14.230 --> 11:18.030
You and the Reaper are destined to be attracted.

11:18.440 --> 11:22.030
No matter how much you try to deny it.

11:24.330 --> 11:27.200
20% left on the battery.

11:28.000 --> 11:31.500
I'm going to try one last reboot.

11:31.500 --> 11:33.500
My left hand's the only thing not covered.

11:34.670 --> 11:36.340
I have to get back home.

11:36.340 --> 11:39.880
I promised I'd get back home.

11:39.880 --> 11:40.800
Kasane...

11:41.430 --> 11:42.340
Akashi...

11:45.550 --> 11:47.260
How was it?

11:48.350 --> 11:51.310
Why're you showing me something like this?

11:51.310 --> 11:53.440
Why do you think?

11:53.440 --> 11:56.320
I know that Aoshi died inside the Reaper.

11:56.820 --> 11:59.570
That memory seeped into the Reaper.

11:59.570 --> 12:01.280
Yes, that!

12:01.280 --> 12:04.820
Aoshi-kun died, <i>right</i>?

12:05.990 --> 12:08.740
Did you see his dead body?

12:09.200 --> 12:15.130
Oh, that's right. Kasane-kun handled the
funeral for you since you were still a child.

12:15.130 --> 12:19.130
Surely she was depressed about how her lover passed away.

12:19.920 --> 12:23.630
She was crying when she was informed of his passing,

12:23.630 --> 12:26.760
but there were no tears at the funeral.

12:27.350 --> 12:31.270
That's because she was doing
her best not to be seen crying.

12:31.270 --> 12:32.230
Come.

12:32.690 --> 12:37.940
The mental protection system of the Shirogane that Aoshi-kun piloted was incomplete.

12:37.940 --> 12:40.440
It didn't properly resonate with him.

12:40.900 --> 12:43.990
I had pointed that fact out from the beginning.

12:47.370 --> 12:52.750
Because, of course, using humans is
best for resonating with other humans.

12:52.750 --> 12:54.750
Using humans?

12:54.750 --> 12:58.380
That's right. The truth is surprisingly simple.

12:58.750 --> 13:04.340
So the system that was completed based on my theory was the Linker Interface Module.

13:04.880 --> 13:06.220
The LIM.

13:13.730 --> 13:14.690
LIM?

13:17.600 --> 13:23.530
When Aoshi-kun returned from the Lightless Realm with his entire body covered in Necrometal,

13:23.530 --> 13:25.450
my heart leapt with joy.

13:26.360 --> 13:27.410
Returned?

13:27.410 --> 13:31.540
That's right! Since he was going to become proof for my theory!

13:31.910 --> 13:35.500
What do you mean by returned?

13:35.500 --> 13:37.790
What do I mean?

13:37.790 --> 13:39.710
That he was still alive!

13:39.710 --> 13:41.340
Alive?

13:41.340 --> 13:42.760
Impossible.

13:42.760 --> 13:43.960
Because he...

13:44.590 --> 13:46.590
No ifs, ands, or buts!

13:46.590 --> 13:48.970
He couldn't return unless he was alive!

13:49.600 --> 13:52.890
Of course, I did check if he was
willing to go through with it.

13:52.890 --> 13:54.930
He willingly obliged.

13:55.310 --> 13:58.150
He volunteered to become a LIM.

13:58.150 --> 14:00.230
Hold on a second.

14:00.230 --> 14:01.900
What you're saying is...

14:02.360 --> 14:04.320
I'll let you see him.

14:25.010 --> 14:26.670
Aoshi...

14:32.890 --> 14:36.140
Your big brother turned into a LIM!

14:36.850 --> 14:39.940
There's no way memories could
seep into something, right?

14:39.940 --> 14:43.440
He was right behind you this entire time.

14:45.860 --> 14:47.490
Don't fuck with me!

14:47.740 --> 14:51.240
I told you the whole truth without holding back.

14:51.240 --> 14:54.120
Now it's your turn to show me some sincerity.

14:54.120 --> 14:55.490
What are you saying?

14:55.870 --> 14:59.370
You left the Sable behind in the Lightless Realm.

14:59.370 --> 15:03.290
Your little teammate Heito-kun and his LIM.

15:04.170 --> 15:06.550
A LIM aboard the Sable?

15:06.550 --> 15:08.380
It's problematic.

15:08.380 --> 15:10.590
Vehicles with a LIM are precious.

15:10.880 --> 15:12.680
Hold on...

15:12.680 --> 15:16.180
Don't tell me that LIM is another person...

15:16.520 --> 15:18.980
Oh, that's right.

15:18.980 --> 15:23.400
She kept incoherently muttering over and
over that she wanted to defeat the Corpses.

15:25.400 --> 15:26.650
Akashi...

15:27.360 --> 15:30.320
Defeat the Corpse...

15:30.990 --> 15:34.030
Emiru... It can't be.

15:34.030 --> 15:37.290
She must've had some grudge against it.

15:37.580 --> 15:39.290
Damn you! Doing this...

15:39.660 --> 15:41.710
Will you run off and tell everyone?

15:41.710 --> 15:43.250
That's fine with me!

15:43.250 --> 15:46.250
Then everyone will want to quit Gargouille,

15:46.250 --> 15:49.550
causing the entire world to be
swallowed by the Lightless Realm.

15:49.550 --> 15:51.090
Congratulations!

15:52.550 --> 15:55.260
You have three choices:

15:55.600 --> 16:00.390
Run away by yourself,
forcing everyone else to deal with all this.

16:00.390 --> 16:04.270
Let everyone in on what's going on,
and you can all run away.

16:04.900 --> 16:07.270
Or better yet... That's right!

16:07.270 --> 16:10.240
Pilot the Reaper once more!

16:12.200 --> 16:17.950
Now that you know everything, you're on the same side as myself and Kasane-kun.

16:17.950 --> 16:19.580
Kasane-san?

16:19.580 --> 16:21.160
That's right.

16:22.790 --> 16:27.040
This was something I wasn't
going to let anyone else listen to,

16:27.040 --> 16:30.760
but I'll give it you. Think of it as a gift for you two brothers' reuniting.

16:31.630 --> 16:35.840
There was only several minutes of visual data earlier.

16:35.840 --> 16:41.730
However, the audio data here has it all,
from the Corpse's assault until the very end.

16:42.640 --> 16:48.070
You should reflect on memories of the
Lightless Realm with your big brother now.

16:55.910 --> 16:59.120
The brothers are meeting face to face right now.

17:03.750 --> 17:08.090
So you were there all this time?

17:09.500 --> 17:12.340
And even after ending up looking like a monster...

17:14.340 --> 17:15.300
Akashi...

17:17.010 --> 17:18.300
Kasane-san...

17:18.720 --> 17:20.680
You knew about this?

17:20.680 --> 17:21.520
All of it?

17:22.140 --> 17:23.430
I'm sorry...

17:24.140 --> 17:29.980
I tried to tell you many times, but I couldn't bring myself to say something like this.

17:29.980 --> 17:33.070
But of course you couldn't! This is insane!

17:33.490 --> 17:34.780
What was that about the Reaper?!

17:34.780 --> 17:36.780
You guys <i>are</i> the reaper!

17:37.110 --> 17:41.370
You tricked Aoshi so you could use him for that bastard's research!

17:41.370 --> 17:43.660
There's no way Aoshi would accept this!

17:44.710 --> 17:45.870
I get it.

17:45.870 --> 17:48.710
That's why you didn't cry at his funeral.

17:48.710 --> 17:51.000
You were actually ecstatic!

17:51.000 --> 17:54.800
I don't care about this LIM stuff, but I'm glad it went well for you!

17:55.170 --> 17:57.010
What would you know!

18:03.310 --> 18:05.430
I wanted him to be alive...

18:06.690 --> 18:08.440
No matter in what form...

18:09.400 --> 18:13.150
I just wanted him to be alive.

18:14.110 --> 18:18.570
That, and it's true that Aoshi accepted it all.

18:19.780 --> 18:21.410
We didn't trick him.

18:25.040 --> 18:29.370
I was the first person to
ever try piloting the Argent.

18:29.370 --> 18:33.050
But it was no good.

18:33.050 --> 18:35.010
He wouldn't accept me.

18:37.050 --> 18:42.050
I realized it when the Argent accepted you, Akashi.

18:42.050 --> 18:45.020
Aoshi's alive, even as a LIM.

18:45.520 --> 18:52.650
And that Aoshi wasn't waiting for me, but for you instead.

18:53.480 --> 18:57.940
Even after turning into a LIM,
the spirit continues to live on.

18:58.400 --> 19:00.990
Even after turning into a LIM, the spirit...

19:02.280 --> 19:06.450
I wish you were the one I synchronized with...

19:07.250 --> 19:10.370
You are on the same side as myself and Kasane-kun.

19:11.380 --> 19:12.710
On the same side?

19:13.540 --> 19:15.000
Maybe so...

19:17.460 --> 19:21.390
Kasane-san, did you listen to this?

19:22.390 --> 19:24.390
This is... Shirogane...

19:24.390 --> 19:27.890
Location... former Okura block one in Setagaya ward...

19:28.640 --> 19:31.190
Two minutes to target location.

19:33.520 --> 19:34.400
What the hell—

19:37.860 --> 19:41.070
This is when the Corpse attacked...

19:38.780 --> 19:42.030
Shirogane here! I'm under attack!

19:42.030 --> 19:44.320
I'd like to retreat for now to reassess!

19:44.780 --> 19:47.370
I'll protect Akashi from now on.

19:47.830 --> 19:49.870
From now on, I'll...

19:49.870 --> 19:52.370
Someone has to do it.

19:52.370 --> 19:54.330
I'll make sure I come back.

19:54.330 --> 19:54.380
Lightless Realm Investigation

19:54.330 --> 19:54.380
Aoshi Saginuma (Age 19) Passes Test

19:54.380 --> 19:54.420
Lightless Realm Investigation

19:54.840 --> 19:57.090
What the hell was that?

19:59.460 --> 20:01.680
Control room, please copy!

20:03.390 --> 20:05.930
My body... What is this?

20:05.930 --> 20:08.220
Control room! Control room!

20:08.220 --> 20:10.480
My leg... Why?

20:10.480 --> 20:12.480
What the heck... What is this?

20:13.100 --> 20:15.060
What's happening to me?

20:15.440 --> 20:16.190
Help!

20:16.190 --> 20:18.610
He's scared...

20:16.650 --> 20:18.610
Someone help me!

20:19.610 --> 20:21.820
Is this really Aoshi?

20:21.820 --> 20:24.320
Why'd I come to a place like this?

20:24.320 --> 20:27.120
I don't want to die! I don't want to die!

20:29.040 --> 20:31.750
You're the one who deserves to die the most.

20:31.750 --> 20:33.460
Just die.

20:33.460 --> 20:36.460
Why are you... smiling?

20:36.460 --> 20:38.750
Don't come near me! Get awa—

20:40.760 --> 20:42.510
I see...

20:42.510 --> 20:45.890
So you had regrets too.

20:47.550 --> 20:50.720
I'm sure you had grudges and hatred too.

20:54.980 --> 20:57.520
Currently, the Argent cannot deploy.

20:57.520 --> 21:02.490
Therefore, we will be patrolling the area
around the Lightless Realm using Vesses.

21:05.360 --> 21:06.700
Akashi-kun.

21:11.120 --> 21:12.500
Change in operation plans.

21:13.040 --> 21:17.380
We will have the Argent re-enter the
Lightless Realm to recover the Sable.

21:17.380 --> 21:22.090
The two Vesses, like in the previous operation...

22:12.640 --> 22:14.470
That's how it should be.

22:14.470 --> 22:18.230
You don't need a sense of duty nor a sense of justice.

22:18.900 --> 22:21.480
You just have to accept it.

22:21.480 --> 22:23.020
You and me both.

22:24.150 --> 22:25.650
You...

22:25.650 --> 22:27.900
What are you trying to make me do?

22:29.530 --> 22:32.370
Me... The one who was wishing for your death.

22:44.800 --> 22:55.430
Throwing away all my excuses, I traced over my abrased heart

22:55.430 --> 22:59.980
In the coldness of the locker room,

22:59.980 --> 23:06.440
Was an unfulfilled promise, locked away

23:06.940 --> 23:12.910
Dispel the darkness in this fallen world,

23:12.910 --> 23:17.450
And give me a reason why I should continue living

23:17.450 --> 23:22.830
The meaning of good-byes, the expectations of people,

23:22.830 --> 23:27.710
And the melodies that we played while never crossing paths

23:27.710 --> 23:33.430
I know I must not run away. The only path is straight ahead

23:33.430 --> 23:37.930
Even if this turns out to be a mistake

23:37.930 --> 23:43.520
The whirlpools of destiny will consume all loneliness

23:43.520 --> 23:51.610
It is an unerasable scar, an egoism that cannot be discarded

24:05.000 --> 24:10.010
Episode 10

24:05.000 --> 24:10.010
Your Song
